Each --category value goes into the query as its own categories pair, in the order given. The flag repeats and takes a comma list.
-- args --
training
search
--category
FBT_ADAPTIVE
--category
STRENGTH,ITP
-- route POST /trainingplan-service/trainingplan/search?start=1&limit=1000&locale=en&categories=FBT_ADAPTIVE&categories=STRENGTH&categories=ITP --
